<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"><title>🛒 नया ऑर्डर मिला! — {{orderId}}</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#ece8df;font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;">
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#ece8df;padding:24px 0;">
  <tr><td align="center">
    <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:600px;width:100%;background-color:#fdf9f0;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
      {{> header}}

      <tr><td style="background-color:#e8f5e9;padding:20px 32px;border-bottom:3px solid #2e7d32;">
        <p style="font-family:'Sora',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#2e7d32;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 4px 0;">🛒 नया ऑर्डर प्राप्त हुआ</p>
        <h1 style="font-family:'Sora',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#08241a;margin:0;">{{orderId}}</h1>
      </td></tr>

      <tr><td style="padding:28px 32px;">
        <p style="font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#3a3a3a;margin:0 0 20px 0;line-height:1.7;">
          नमस्ते {{farmerName}}, आपको एक नया ऑर्डर मिला है! Please prepare the following items for dispatch:
        </p>

        {{!-- Items --}}
        {{> order-items-table}}

        {{!-- Order Stats --}}
        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f7f3ea;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:20px;">
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:16px;width:33%;text-align:center;vertical-align:top;border-right:1px solid #e8e4da;">
              <p style="font-family:'Sora',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#5a5a5a;margin:0 0 4px 0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;">Order Value</p>
              <p style="font-family:'Sora',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#08241a;margin:0;">{{inr orderTotal}}</p>
            </td>
            <td style="padding:16px;width:33%;text-align:center;vertical-align:top;border-right:1px solid #e8e4da;">
              <p style="font-family:'Sora',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#5a5a5a;margin:0 0 4px 0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;">Buyer District</p>
              <p style="font-family:'Sora',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#08241a;margin:0;">{{buyerDistrict}}</p>
            </td>
            <td style="padding:16px;width:33%;text-align:center;vertical-align:top;">
              <p style="font-family:'Sora',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#5a5a5a;margin:0 0 4px 0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;">Dispatch By</p>
              <p style="font-family:'Sora',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#e78353;margin:0;">{{dateFormat dispatchBy}}</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>

        <div style="background-color:#fff3e0;border:1px solid #e78353;border-radius:6px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:20px;">
          <p style="font-family:'Sora',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#e65100;margin:0 0 6px 0;">📋 Next Steps</p>
          <ol style="font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#3a3a3a;margin:0;padding-left:20px;line-height:1.8;">
            <li>Confirm the order from your dashboard</li>
            <li>Pack the produce as per quality standards</li>
            <li>Mark as PACKED when ready for pickup</li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
          <tr><td align="center" style="padding:8px 0 16px 0;">
            <a href="{{orderUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#08241a;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Sora',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:6px;">View Order Details →</a>
          </td></tr>
        </table>
      </td></tr>

      {{> footer}}
    </table>
  </td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
